Why you using &lt;tt&gt;ThreadLocalRandom&lt;/tt&gt;, when the method (&lt;tt&gt;testValidateSingleCacheShouldNotTriggerCacheGroupValidation()&lt;/tt&gt;) can be used from one thread only? Is rely necessary to use random values here? (I think predefined values will be enough there - for example &lt;tt&gt;i&lt;/tt&gt; instead of &lt;tt&gt;rand.nextInt()&lt;/tt&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
